                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "Had a great time with this one. It's basically a sequel to the previous game which was also pretty good!\n\nhttps://store.steampowered.com/app/286100/You_Have_to_Win_the_Game/\n\nThis game adds a full overworld with more secrets and collectibles. Lots of well-designed areas as well as enemies and obstacles that usually never felt too unfair or overwhelming, while still keeping a pretty decent difficulty level demanding excellence in many scenarios. Like the first game, I did not complete the additional challenge run(s) so there's even more to do than just getting 100% in a full run if you love this kinda thing. \n\nOverall, I think it's certainly a positive experience and definitely worth a purchase on sale.",
                        "timestamp_created": 1786958338,
                        "timestamp_updated": 1786958338,
                        "voted_up": true,
